/engcalcs

# A PHP fatal in tools/ wrote this over HTTP while that directory was publicly
# executable (closed 2026-09-18, tools/.htaccess). It is a server artefact, never
# source, and it must not be committed: it can carry paths and request detail.
tools/error_log
error_log
